{"reviewId": "66920859_82bRegCC6", "review": {"abstract": "这种对康波进入衰退阶段的解释简单而牵强，实际上我们的理解是，当效率降低时，资本主义体系仍然期望按照原有的增长速度运行，这就必然会增加资本投资。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这个思路很有意思，当技术进步带来的利润逐渐下降的时候，资本家为了保持利润开始扩大规模，于是资源价格大涨。这个思路听起来好像没问题，但是如何验证？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4469-4540", "createTime": 1754437642, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "66920859_82bRegCC6", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 928448853, "name": "贾晓璟 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PMdyqb5x5xQjEftHEpiab0jhIG36wq3JArAt81NULmPUvuFiaBRrFsDAaOdN3CSic0IXs4NiaiarX8lLNUpSa1n2QXCibfm9rI1zqZSFY6XSEIicJE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [],